flowchart LR
    U[Usuario] --> UI[Interfaz web - Streamlit, ui/app.py]
    UI -->|HTTP| API[FastAPI - src/api/main.py]
    API --> ORQ[Orchestrator - src/api/orchestrator.py]
    ORQ --> ING[Ingestion - service.py]
    ORQ --> PROC[Processing - chunking.py]
    PROC --> EMB[Embeddings - factory.py: Gemini/Mock]
    EMB --> VS[(ChromaDB - vectorstore/store.py)]
    VS --> RAG[RAG - retrieval_service.py]
    RAG --> CTX[context_builder.py]
    CTX -->|NO_CONTEXT si score bajo| OUT
    CTX --> GEN[Generation - orchestrator.py: LLMProvider]
    GEN --> VAL[Validation - fidelity_checker.py: LLM-juez + score en Python]
    VAL --> OUT[Output - assembler.py: NuevaMenteOutput]
    OUT --> STO[(OCI Object Storage / mock_client.py)]
    OUT --> DB[(SQLite - db/session.py, jobs)]
    OUT --> API
    API --> UI
